-- Tests for Chuong II, Muc 1 (Dieu 15-32). Expected values are read from the cited source lines.
-- Law 139/2025/QH15 does not amend these articles, so the same scenario gives the same answer in
-- every vintage; test `the same in all three vintages` below says so once.

§ `Tests: Chuong II, Muc 1`

§§ `Persons and contracts used throughout`

`an adult person` MEANS `A person` WITH
    `is an organisation` IS FALSE
    `is a minor` IS FALSE
    `has lost civil act capacity` IS FALSE
    `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour` IS FALSE
    `has limited civil act capacity` IS FALSE
`a minor person` MEANS `A person` WITH
    `is an organisation` IS FALSE
    `is a minor` IS TRUE
    `has lost civil act capacity` IS FALSE
    `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour` IS FALSE
    `has limited civil act capacity` IS FALSE
`a person who lost capacity` MEANS `A person` WITH
    `is an organisation` IS FALSE
    `is a minor` IS FALSE
    `has lost civil act capacity` IS TRUE
    `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour` IS FALSE
    `has limited civil act capacity` IS FALSE
`a person with difficulty in cognition` MEANS `A person` WITH
    `is an organisation` IS FALSE
    `is a minor` IS FALSE
    `has lost civil act capacity` IS FALSE
    `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour` IS TRUE
    `has limited civil act capacity` IS FALSE
`a person with limited capacity` MEANS `A person` WITH
    `is an organisation` IS FALSE
    `is a minor` IS FALSE
    `has lost civil act capacity` IS FALSE
    `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour` IS FALSE
    `has limited civil act capacity` IS TRUE
`an organisation person` MEANS `A person` WITH
    `is an organisation` IS TRUE
    `is a minor` IS FALSE
    `has lost civil act capacity` IS FALSE
    `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour` IS FALSE
    `has limited civil act capacity` IS FALSE

`a property contract` MEANS `A contract of insurance` WITH
    `class of contract` IS `a property insurance contract`
    `insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `policyholder` IS `an adult person`
    `insured person` IS `an adult person`
    `is a group contract` IS FALSE
    `is a maritime insurance contract` IS FALSE
    `date the contract was made` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `first day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `last day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `sum insured` IS 0
`a life contract` MEANS `A contract of insurance` WITH
    `class of contract` IS `a life insurance contract`
    `insurer` IS `a life insurer`
    `policyholder` IS `an adult person`
    `insured person` IS `an adult person`
    `is a group contract` IS FALSE
    `is a maritime insurance contract` IS FALSE
    `date the contract was made` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `first day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `last day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `sum insured` IS 0
`a health contract` MEANS `A contract of insurance` WITH
    `class of contract` IS `a health insurance contract`
    `insurer` IS `a health insurer`
    `policyholder` IS `an adult person`
    `insured person` IS `an adult person`
    `is a group contract` IS FALSE
    `is a maritime insurance contract` IS FALSE
    `date the contract was made` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `first day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `last day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `sum insured` IS 0
`a group life contract` MEANS `A contract of insurance` WITH
    `class of contract` IS `a life insurance contract`
    `insurer` IS `a life insurer`
    `policyholder` IS `an organisation person`
    `insured person` IS `an adult person`
    `is a group contract` IS TRUE
    `is a maritime insurance contract` IS FALSE
    `date the contract was made` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `first day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `last day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `sum insured` IS 0
`a maritime contract` MEANS `A contract of insurance` WITH
    `class of contract` IS `a property insurance contract`
    `insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `policyholder` IS `an adult person`
    `insured person` IS `an adult person`
    `is a group contract` IS FALSE
    `is a maritime insurance contract` IS TRUE
    `date the contract was made` IS YMD 2025 3 10
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `first day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `last day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `sum insured` IS 0

§§ `Dieu 15`

-- src:370 | 1. Các loại hợp đồng bảo hiểm bao gồm:
-- src:371 | a) Hợp đồng bảo hiểm nhân thọ;
-- src:372 | b) Hợp đồng bảo hiểm sức khỏe;
-- src:373 | c) Hợp đồng bảo hiểm tài sản;
-- src:374 | d) Hợp đồng bảo hiểm thiệt hại;
-- src:375 | đ) Hợp đồng bảo hiểm trách nhiệm.
-- src:376 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm quy định tại các điểm c, d và đ khoản này thuộc loại hình
-- src:377 | bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ.
-- src:378 | 2. Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ
-- src:379 | nước ngoài và bên mua bảo hiểm có thể thỏa thuận giao kết một loại hợp đồng bảo
-- src:380 | hiểm hoặc kết hợp nhiều loại hợp đồng bảo hiểm quy định tại khoản 1 Điều này và
-- src:381 | bảo đảm phù hợp với quy định tại khoản 3 Điều 63 của Luật này.
-- src:382 | 3. Hợp đồng bảo hiểm hàng hải được thực hiện theo quy định của Bộ luật
-- src:383 | Hàng hải; nội dung không quy định tại Bộ luật Hàng hải thì thực hiện theo quy
-- src:384 | định của Luật này.
-- src:385 | 4. Nội dung liên quan đến hợp đồng bảo hiểm không được quy định trong Luật
-- src:386 | này thì thực hiện theo quy định của Bộ luật Dân sự.
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(1): the type of insurance the class of contract belongs to` `a life insurance contract` EQUALS `life insurance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(1): the type of insurance the class of contract belongs to` `a health insurance contract` EQUALS `health insurance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(1): the type of insurance the class of contract belongs to` `a property insurance contract` EQUALS `non-life insurance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(1): the type of insurance the class of contract belongs to` `a damage insurance contract` EQUALS `non-life insurance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(1): the type of insurance the class of contract belongs to` `a liability insurance contract` EQUALS `non-life insurance`

-- Dieu 15(2) with Dieu 63(3): a life insurer may add health cover, a non-life insurer may not add life cover.
`a short term-life product` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `life insurance`
    `term in months` IS 12
    `covers the risk of death` IS TRUE
    `is a term-life product` IS TRUE
`a life product of ten years` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `life insurance`
    `term in months` IS 120
    `covers the risk of death` IS TRUE
    `is a term-life product` IS FALSE
`a health product of ten years` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `health insurance`
    `term in months` IS 120
    `covers the risk of death` IS FALSE
    `is a term-life product` IS FALSE
`a health product of one year` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `health insurance`
    `term in months` IS 12
    `covers the risk of death` IS FALSE
    `is a term-life product` IS FALSE
`a motor product` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `non-life insurance`
    `term in months` IS 12
    `covers the risk of death` IS FALSE
    `is a term-life product` IS FALSE
`a life insurer selling life and health` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a life insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a life product of ten years`, `a health product of ten years`
`a non-life insurer selling a life product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a motor product`, `a life product of ten years`
`a combination of life and health` MEANS `A combination of classes` WITH
    `classes combined` IS LIST `a life insurance contract`, `a health insurance contract`
`no classes combined` MEANS `A combination of classes` WITH
    `classes combined` IS EMPTY

#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 15(2): the classes combined are consistent with Dieu 63(3)` `a combination of life and health` `a life insurer selling life and health`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 15(2): the classes combined are consistent with Dieu 63(3)` `a combination of life and health` `a non-life insurer selling a life product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 15(2): the classes combined are consistent with Dieu 63(3)` `no classes combined` `a life insurer selling life and health`)

-- Dieu 15(3)-(4)
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(3)-(4): the instrument that governs the matter` `a maritime contract` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the Maritime Code`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(3)-(4): the instrument that governs the matter` `a maritime contract` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `this Law`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(3)-(4): the instrument that governs the matter` `a maritime contract` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the Civil Code`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(3)-(4): the instrument that governs the matter` `a property contract` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `this Law`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(3)-(4): the instrument that governs the matter` `a property contract` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the Civil Code`

§§ `Dieu 16`

-- src:399 | 3. Nguyên tắc bồi thường: số tiền bồi thường mà người được bảo hiểm nhận
-- src:400 | được không vượt quá thiệt hại thực tế trong sự kiện bảo hiểm, trừ trường hợp có
-- src:401 | thỏa thuận khác trong hợp đồng bảo hiểm;
-- src:402 | 4. Nguyên tắc thế quyền: người được bảo hiểm có trách nhiệm chuyển giao
-- src:403 | cho doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ nước
-- src:404 | ngoài quyền yêu cầu người thứ ba có hành vi gây thiệt hại chịu trách nhiệm bồi
-- src:405 | hoàn trong phạm vi số tiền bồi thường bảo hiểm. Nguyên tắc này không áp dụng
-- src:406 | đối với hợp đồng bảo hiểm nhân thọ và hợp đồng bảo hiểm sức khỏe;
@ref Dieu 16 (src:399-406)
`compensation within the loss` MEANS `A compensation` WITH
    `compensation` IS 80_000_000
    `actual loss in the insured event` IS 100_000_000
    `the contract agrees otherwise` IS FALSE
`compensation equal to the loss` MEANS `A compensation` WITH
    `compensation` IS 100_000_000
    `actual loss in the insured event` IS 100_000_000
    `the contract agrees otherwise` IS FALSE
`compensation above the loss` MEANS `A compensation` WITH
    `compensation` IS 100_000_001
    `actual loss in the insured event` IS 100_000_000
    `the contract agrees otherwise` IS FALSE
`compensation above the loss as agreed` MEANS `A compensation` WITH
    `compensation` IS 150_000_000
    `actual loss in the insured event` IS 100_000_000
    `the contract agrees otherwise` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `Dieu 16(3): the compensation respects the indemnity principle` `compensation within the loss`
#ASSERT `Dieu 16(3): the compensation respects the indemnity principle` `compensation equal to the loss`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 16(3): the compensation respects the indemnity principle` `compensation above the loss`
#ASSERT `Dieu 16(3): the compensation respects the indemnity principle` `compensation above the loss as agreed`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 16(4): the subrogation principle applies to the class` `a life insurance contract`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 16(4): the subrogation principle applies to the class` `a health insurance contract`
#ASSERT `Dieu 16(4): the subrogation principle applies to the class` `a property insurance contract`
#ASSERT `Dieu 16(4): the subrogation principle applies to the class` `a liability insurance contract`

§§ `Dieu 17 and 18`

-- src:410 | 1. Hợp đồng bảo hiểm phải có những nội dung chủ yếu sau đây:
-- src:411 | a) Bên mua bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm, người thụ hưởng (nếu có), doanh
-- src:412 | nghiệp bảo hiểm hoặc chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ nước ngoài;
-- src:413 | b) Đối tượng bảo hiểm;
-- src:414 | c) Số tiền bảo hiểm hoặc giá trị tài sản được bảo hiểm hoặc giới hạn trách
-- src:415 | nhiệm bảo hiểm;
-- src:416 | d) Phạm vi hoặc quyền lợi bảo hiểm; quy tắc, điều kiện, điều khoản bảo hiểm;
-- src:417 | đ) Quyền và nghĩa vụ của doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo
-- src:418 | hiểm phi nhân thọ nước ngoài và bên mua bảo hiểm;
-- src:419 | e) Thời hạn bảo hiểm, thời điểm có hiệu lực của hợp đồng bảo hiểm;
-- src:420 | g) Mức phí bảo hiểm, phương thức đóng phí bảo hiểm;
-- src:421 | h) Phương thức bồi thường, trả tiền bảo hiểm;
-- src:422 | i) Phương thức giải quyết tranh chấp.
@ref Dieu 17 (src:410-422)
`a complete contract` MEANS `The contents of a contract` WITH
    `states the policyholder, the insured person, the beneficiary if any and the insurer` IS TRUE
    `states the object of insurance` IS TRUE
    `states the sum insured or the value of insured property or the limit of liability` IS TRUE
    `states the scope or benefits of insurance and the rules, conditions and terms` IS TRUE
    `states the rights and obligations of the insurer and the policyholder` IS TRUE
    `states the insurance term and when the contract takes effect` IS TRUE
    `states the premium and the method of paying it` IS TRUE
    `states the method of paying compensation or the insurance money` IS TRUE
    `states the method of resolving disputes` IS TRUE
`a contract without a dispute clause` MEANS `The contents of a contract` WITH
    `states the policyholder, the insured person, the beneficiary if any and the insurer` IS TRUE
    `states the object of insurance` IS TRUE
    `states the sum insured or the value of insured property or the limit of liability` IS TRUE
    `states the scope or benefits of insurance and the rules, conditions and terms` IS TRUE
    `states the rights and obligations of the insurer and the policyholder` IS TRUE
    `states the insurance term and when the contract takes effect` IS TRUE
    `states the premium and the method of paying it` IS TRUE
    `states the method of paying compensation or the insurance money` IS TRUE
    `states the method of resolving disputes` IS FALSE
`a contract without the object` MEANS `The contents of a contract` WITH
    `states the policyholder, the insured person, the beneficiary if any and the insurer` IS TRUE
    `states the object of insurance` IS FALSE
    `states the sum insured or the value of insured property or the limit of liability` IS TRUE
    `states the scope or benefits of insurance and the rules, conditions and terms` IS TRUE
    `states the rights and obligations of the insurer and the policyholder` IS TRUE
    `states the insurance term and when the contract takes effect` IS TRUE
    `states the premium and the method of paying it` IS TRUE
    `states the method of paying compensation or the insurance money` IS TRUE
    `states the method of resolving disputes` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `Dieu 17(1): the contract states the essential contents` `a complete contract`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 17(1): the contract states the essential contents` `a contract without a dispute clause`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 17(1): the contract states the essential contents` `a contract without the object`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 17(2): the Minister of Finance's detailed rules on contents for the class` `a life insurance contract`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 17(2): the Minister of Finance's detailed rules on contents for the class` `a health insurance contract`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 17(2): the Minister of Finance's detailed rules on contents for the class` `a property insurance contract`

-- src:428 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm phải được lập thành văn bản. Bằng chứng giao kết hợp
-- src:429 | đồng bảo hiểm là hợp đồng, giấy chứng nhận bảo hiểm, đơn bảo hiểm hoặc hình
-- src:430 | thức khác theo quy định của pháp luật.
@ref Dieu 18 (src:428-430)
`a written contract with a certificate` MEANS `The form of a contract` WITH
    `is made in writing` IS TRUE
    `evidenced by the contract itself` IS FALSE
    `evidenced by a certificate of insurance` IS TRUE
    `evidenced by an insurance application or policy` IS FALSE
    `evidenced by another form the law provides` IS FALSE
`an oral contract` MEANS `The form of a contract` WITH
    `is made in writing` IS FALSE
    `evidenced by the contract itself` IS TRUE
    `evidenced by a certificate of insurance` IS FALSE
    `evidenced by an insurance application or policy` IS FALSE
    `evidenced by another form the law provides` IS FALSE
`a written contract with no evidence` MEANS `The form of a contract` WITH
    `is made in writing` IS TRUE
    `evidenced by the contract itself` IS FALSE
    `evidenced by a certificate of insurance` IS FALSE
    `evidenced by an insurance application or policy` IS FALSE
    `evidenced by another form the law provides` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 18: the contract is in the form the Law requires` `a written contract with a certificate`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 18: the contract is in the form the Law requires` `an oral contract`
#ASSERT `Dieu 18: the making of the contract is evidenced` `a written contract with a certificate`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 18: the making of the contract is evidenced` `a written contract with no evidence`

§§ `Dieu 19`

-- src:432 | 1. Điều khoản loại trừ trách nhiệm bảo hiểm quy định các trường hợp doanh
-- src:433 | nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ nước ngoài
-- src:434 | không phải bồi thường, trả tiền bảo hiểm.
-- src:435 | 2. Trường hợp có điều khoản loại trừ trách nhiệm bảo hiểm, doanh nghiệp bảo
-- src:436 | hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ nước ngoài phải quy định rõ
-- src:437 | trong hợp đồng bảo hiểm, phải giải thích rõ ràng, đầy đủ và có bằng chứng xác
-- src:438 | nhận việc bên mua bảo hiểm đã được doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh
-- src:439 | nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ nước ngoài giải thích đầy đủ và hiểu rõ nội dung này
-- src:440 | khi giao kết hợp đồng bảo hiểm.
-- src:441 | 3. Trường hợp có sự kiện bất khả kháng hoặc trở ngại khách quan dẫn đến bên
-- src:442 | mua bảo hiểm chậm thông báo sự kiện bảo hiểm thì doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi
-- src:443 | nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ nước ngoài không được áp dụng điều
-- src:444 | khoản loại trừ trách nhiệm bảo hiểm về việc chậm thông báo.
@ref Dieu 19 (src:432-444)
`no exclusion clause` MEANS `An exclusion clause` WITH
    `the contract has an exclusion clause` IS FALSE
    `the contract states the exclusion clearly` IS FALSE
    `the insurer explained the exclusion clearly and fully` IS FALSE
    `there is evidence the policyholder was given the explanation and understood it` IS FALSE
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle caused the policyholder to notify the insured event late` IS FALSE
    `the exclusion is for late notice` IS FALSE
`an exclusion clause properly handled` MEANS `An exclusion clause` WITH
    `the contract has an exclusion clause` IS TRUE
    `the contract states the exclusion clearly` IS TRUE
    `the insurer explained the exclusion clearly and fully` IS TRUE
    `there is evidence the policyholder was given the explanation and understood it` IS TRUE
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle caused the policyholder to notify the insured event late` IS FALSE
    `the exclusion is for late notice` IS FALSE
`an exclusion clause not explained` MEANS `An exclusion clause` WITH
    `the contract has an exclusion clause` IS TRUE
    `the contract states the exclusion clearly` IS TRUE
    `the insurer explained the exclusion clearly and fully` IS FALSE
    `there is evidence the policyholder was given the explanation and understood it` IS TRUE
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle caused the policyholder to notify the insured event late` IS FALSE
    `the exclusion is for late notice` IS FALSE
`an exclusion clause without evidence` MEANS `An exclusion clause` WITH
    `the contract has an exclusion clause` IS TRUE
    `the contract states the exclusion clearly` IS TRUE
    `the insurer explained the exclusion clearly and fully` IS TRUE
    `there is evidence the policyholder was given the explanation and understood it` IS FALSE
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle caused the policyholder to notify the insured event late` IS FALSE
    `the exclusion is for late notice` IS FALSE
`a late-notice exclusion after force majeure` MEANS `An exclusion clause` WITH
    `the contract has an exclusion clause` IS FALSE
    `the contract states the exclusion clearly` IS FALSE
    `the insurer explained the exclusion clearly and fully` IS FALSE
    `there is evidence the policyholder was given the explanation and understood it` IS FALSE
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle caused the policyholder to notify the insured event late` IS TRUE
    `the exclusion is for late notice` IS TRUE
`a late-notice exclusion with no excuse` MEANS `An exclusion clause` WITH
    `the contract has an exclusion clause` IS FALSE
    `the contract states the exclusion clearly` IS FALSE
    `the insurer explained the exclusion clearly and fully` IS FALSE
    `there is evidence the policyholder was given the explanation and understood it` IS FALSE
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle caused the policyholder to notify the insured event late` IS FALSE
    `the exclusion is for late notice` IS TRUE
`force majeure delay under another exclusion` MEANS `An exclusion clause` WITH
    `the contract has an exclusion clause` IS FALSE
    `the contract states the exclusion clearly` IS FALSE
    `the insurer explained the exclusion clearly and fully` IS FALSE
    `there is evidence the policyholder was given the explanation and understood it` IS FALSE
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle caused the policyholder to notify the insured event late` IS TRUE
    `the exclusion is for late notice` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 19(2): the insurer has done what it must about the exclusion clause` `no exclusion clause`
#ASSERT `Dieu 19(2): the insurer has done what it must about the exclusion clause` `an exclusion clause properly handled`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 19(2): the insurer has done what it must about the exclusion clause` `an exclusion clause not explained`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 19(2): the insurer has done what it must about the exclusion clause` `an exclusion clause without evidence`
#ASSERT `Dieu 19(3): the late-notice exclusion may not be applied` `a late-notice exclusion after force majeure`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 19(3): the late-notice exclusion may not be applied` `a late-notice exclusion with no excuse`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 19(3): the late-notice exclusion may not be applied` `force majeure delay under another exclusion`

§§ `Dieu 20 and 21`

-- src:447 | 1. Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ
-- src:448 | nước ngoài có các quyền sau đây:
-- src:449 | a) Thu phí bảo hiểm theo thỏa thuận trong hợp đồng bảo hiểm;
-- src:450 | b) Yêu cầu bên mua bảo hiểm cung cấp đầy đủ, trung thực mọi thông tin có
-- src:451 | liên quan đến việc giao kết và thực hiện hợp đồng bảo hiểm;
-- src:452 | c) Hủy bỏ hợp đồng bảo hiểm quy định tại khoản 2 Điều 22 hoặc đơn phương
