`a disclosure to a regulator` MEANS `An insurer's handling of a claim` WITH
    `the event is within the insurer's liability under the contract` IS FALSE
    `an exclusion of liability in the contract applies` IS FALSE
    `the insurer paid` IS FALSE
    `the insurer refused to pay` IS FALSE
