`a deliberate non-disclosure by the policyholder` MEANS `The disclosure at formation` WITH
    `policyholder deliberately gave incomplete or false information to make the contract in order to be paid` IS TRUE
    `insurer deliberately failed to give, or gave false, information in order to make the contract` IS FALSE
    `premium paid` IS 5_000_000
    `reasonable costs the contract allows to be deducted` IS 500_000
    `damage the other side suffered` IS 1_000_000
`a deliberate non-disclosure with costs above the premium` MEANS `The disclosure at formation` WITH
    `policyholder deliberately gave incomplete or false information to make the contract in order to be paid` IS TRUE
    `insurer deliberately failed to give, or gave false, information in order to make the contract` IS FALSE
    `premium paid` IS 5_000_000
    `reasonable costs the contract allows to be deducted` IS 6_000_000
    `damage the other side suffered` IS 0
`a deliberate misstatement by the insurer` MEANS `The disclosure at formation` WITH
    `policyholder deliberately gave incomplete or false information to make the contract in order to be paid` IS FALSE
    `insurer deliberately failed to give, or gave false, information in order to make the contract` IS TRUE
    `premium paid` IS 5_000_000
    `reasonable costs the contract allows to be deducted` IS 500_000
    `damage the other side suffered` IS 0
`an innocent mistake` MEANS `The disclosure at formation` WITH
    `policyholder deliberately gave incomplete or false information to make the contract in order to be paid` IS FALSE
    `insurer deliberately failed to give, or gave false, information in order to make the contract` IS FALSE
    `premium paid` IS 5_000_000
    `reasonable costs the contract allows to be deducted` IS 0
    `damage the other side suffered` IS 0
#ASSERT `Dieu 22(2): the insurer may rescind the contract` `a deliberate non-disclosure by the policyholder`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 22(2): the insurer may rescind the contract` `an innocent mistake`
#ASSERT `Dieu 22(2): the premium the insurer must refund` `a deliberate non-disclosure by the policyholder` EQUALS 4_500_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 22(2): the premium the insurer must refund` `a deliberate non-disclosure with costs above the premium`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 22(2): the premium the insurer must refund` `an innocent mistake`
#ASSERT `Dieu 22(3): the policyholder may rescind the contract` `a deliberate misstatement by the insurer`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 22(3): the policyholder may rescind the contract` `a deliberate non-disclosure by the policyholder`
#ASSERT `Dieu 22(3): the premium the insurer must refund` `a deliberate misstatement by the insurer` EQUALS 5_000_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 22(3): the premium the insurer must refund` `an innocent mistake`

