-- src:689 | đồng bảo hiểm.
@ref Dieu 28 (src:680-689)
`a full life transfer` MEANS `A transfer of a contract` WITH
    `the insured person or the insured person's legal representative agreed in writing` IS TRUE
    `the transferee has an insurable interest` IS TRUE
    `the policyholder notified the insurer in writing` IS TRUE
    `the insurer agreed in writing` IS TRUE
    `the transfer is made under international custom or by agreement in the contract` IS FALSE
`a life transfer without the insured's consent` MEANS `A transfer of a contract` WITH
    `the insured person or the insured person's legal representative agreed in writing` IS FALSE
    `the transferee has an insurable interest` IS TRUE
    `the policyholder notified the insurer in writing` IS TRUE
    `the insurer agreed in writing` IS TRUE
    `the transfer is made under international custom or by agreement in the contract` IS FALSE
`a property transfer without the insurer's agreement` MEANS `A transfer of a contract` WITH
    `the insured person or the insured person's legal representative agreed in writing` IS FALSE
    `the transferee has an insurable interest` IS TRUE
    `the policyholder notified the insurer in writing` IS TRUE
    `the insurer agreed in writing` IS FALSE
    `the transfer is made under international custom or by agreement in the contract` IS FALSE
`a property transfer under the contract's own terms` MEANS `A transfer of a contract` WITH
    `the insured person or the insured person's legal representative agreed in writing` IS FALSE
    `the transferee has an insurable interest` IS TRUE
    `the policyholder notified the insurer in writing` IS FALSE
    `the insurer agreed in writing` IS FALSE
    `the transfer is made under international custom or by agreement in the contract` IS TRUE
`a property transfer to a stranger` MEANS `A transfer of a contract` WITH
    `the insured person or the insured person's legal representative agreed in writing` IS FALSE
    `the transferee has an insurable interest` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder notified the insurer in writing` IS TRUE
    `the insurer agreed in writing` IS TRUE
    `the transfer is made under international custom or by agreement in the contract` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 28: the transfer takes effect` `a full life transfer` `a life contract`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 28: the transfer takes effect` `a life transfer without the insured's consent` `a life contract`
#ASSERT `Dieu 28: the transfer takes effect` `a life transfer without the insured's consent` `a property contract`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 28: the transfer takes effect` `a property transfer without the insurer's agreement` `a property contract`
#ASSERT `Dieu 28: the transfer takes effect` `a property transfer under the contract's own terms` `a property contract`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 28: the transfer takes effect` `a property transfer to a stranger` `a property contract`

§§ `Dieu 29`

