-- src:694 | hiểm. Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ
-- src:695 | nước ngoài không được từ chối hoặc trì hoãn thực hiện trách nhiệm của mình đối
-- src:696 | với bên mua bảo hiểm kể cả trường hợp doanh nghiệp, tổ chức nhận tái bảo hiểm
-- src:697 | không thực hiện nghĩa vụ thanh toán tái bảo hiểm những trách nhiệm đã nhận.
-- src:698 | 2. Doanh nghiệp, tổ chức nhận tái bảo hiểm không được yêu cầu bên mua bảo
-- src:699 | hiểm trực tiếp đóng phí bảo hiểm cho mình, trừ trường hợp có thỏa thuận khác
-- src:700 | trong hợp đồng bảo hiểm.
-- src:701 | 3. Bên mua bảo hiểm không được yêu cầu doanh nghiệp, tổ chức nhận tái bảo
-- src:702 | hiểm bồi thường, trả tiền bảo hiểm cho mình, trừ trường hợp có thỏa thuận khác
-- src:703 | trong hợp đồng bảo hiểm.
@ref Dieu 29 (src:691-703)
`an insurer relying on the reinsurer's default` MEANS `A reinsurance in the background of a contract` WITH
    `the reinsurer did not meet its obligation to the insurer` IS TRUE
    `the insurer refused or delayed performing for the policyholder` IS TRUE
    `the reinsurer asked the policyholder to pay premium directly to it` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder asked the reinsurer to pay the insurance money to it` IS FALSE
    `the contract agrees otherwise` IS FALSE
`an insurer delaying for its own reasons` MEANS `A reinsurance in the background of a contract` WITH
    `the reinsurer did not meet its obligation to the insurer` IS FALSE
    `the insurer refused or delayed performing for the policyholder` IS TRUE
    `the reinsurer asked the policyholder to pay premium directly to it` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder asked the reinsurer to pay the insurance money to it` IS FALSE
    `the contract agrees otherwise` IS FALSE
`a reinsurer collecting premium directly` MEANS `A reinsurance in the background of a contract` WITH
    `the reinsurer did not meet its obligation to the insurer` IS FALSE
    `the insurer refused or delayed performing for the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `the reinsurer asked the policyholder to pay premium directly to it` IS TRUE
    `the policyholder asked the reinsurer to pay the insurance money to it` IS FALSE
    `the contract agrees otherwise` IS FALSE
`a reinsurer collecting premium directly as agreed` MEANS `A reinsurance in the background of a contract` WITH
    `the reinsurer did not meet its obligation to the insurer` IS FALSE
    `the insurer refused or delayed performing for the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `the reinsurer asked the policyholder to pay premium directly to it` IS TRUE
    `the policyholder asked the reinsurer to pay the insurance money to it` IS FALSE
    `the contract agrees otherwise` IS TRUE
`a policyholder claiming on the reinsurer` MEANS `A reinsurance in the background of a contract` WITH
    `the reinsurer did not meet its obligation to the insurer` IS FALSE
    `the insurer refused or delayed performing for the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `the reinsurer asked the policyholder to pay premium directly to it` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder asked the reinsurer to pay the insurance money to it` IS TRUE
    `the contract agrees otherwise` IS FALSE
`a policyholder claiming on the reinsurer as agreed` MEANS `A reinsurance in the background of a contract` WITH
    `the reinsurer did not meet its obligation to the insurer` IS FALSE
    `the insurer refused or delayed performing for the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `the reinsurer asked the policyholder to pay premium directly to it` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder asked the reinsurer to pay the insurance money to it` IS TRUE
    `the contract agrees otherwise` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `Dieu 29(1): the insurer's refusal or delay breaches Dieu 29(1)` `an insurer relying on the reinsurer's default`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 29(1): the insurer's refusal or delay breaches Dieu 29(1)` `an insurer delaying for its own reasons`
#ASSERT `Dieu 29(2): the reinsurer's demand for premium breaches Dieu 29(2)` `a reinsurer collecting premium directly`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 29(2): the reinsurer's demand for premium breaches Dieu 29(2)` `a reinsurer collecting premium directly as agreed`
#ASSERT `Dieu 29(3): the policyholder's demand on the reinsurer breaches Dieu 29(3)` `a policyholder claiming on the reinsurer`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 29(3): the policyholder's demand on the reinsurer breaches Dieu 29(3)` `a policyholder claiming on the reinsurer as agreed`

