#ASSERT `Dieu 31(1): the last day for the insurer to pay` `a claim with a full dossier on 1 April 2025, nothing agreed, paid on the day` EQUALS YMD 2025 4 16
#ASSERT `Dieu 31(2): the days of delay` `a claim with a full dossier on 1 April 2025, nothing agreed, paid on the day` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `Dieu 31(2): the days of delay` `the same paid a day later` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `Dieu 31(2): the days of delay` `the same paid three days later` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `Dieu 31(2): the interest on the late payment` `the same paid three days later` EQUALS 9_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 31(2): the interest on the late payment` `a late payment with no rate supplied`
#ASSERT `Dieu 31(1): the last day for the insurer to pay` `a claim with thirty days agreed, paid on the thirtieth` EQUALS YMD 2025 5 1
#ASSERT `Dieu 31(2): the days of delay` `a claim with thirty days agreed, paid on the thirtieth` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `Dieu 31(2): the days of delay` `a claim with thirty days agreed, paid a day after` EQUALS 1

